      "widgets_values": [
        "SHARED, NOT CLONED\n\nEverything in this column feeds the body from outside, so Close\nleaves it alone: one model load, one LoRA chain, one SAM encode,\none set of reference images. Close reports exactly what it kept\nexternal \u2014 check its `info` output the first time you run.\n\nThe scheduler and the sampler sit here too because they only take\nthe model. RandomNoise is shared and `fixed`: same seed, but each\nchunk is a different latent shape, so each still gets its own\nnoise, and the run repeats exactly."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
